### List plays
GET http://localhost:5000/api/plays?page=1&limit=10

### Search plays
GET http://localhost:5000/api/plays?q=Desert

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/plays/plays-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/plays
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Monsoon Express Play",
  "language": "English",
  "venue": "Indoor Stadium",
  "date": "2026-12-08",
  "price": 249
}
